  "description": "Core contracts and models for NJobDesk, a scheduler-agnostic jobs dashboard for .NET: the scheduler provider abstraction (descriptor, capabilities, registry, multi-provider aggregation with fault isolation), info/management contracts, execution-history store contract, and cron validation. No HTTP surface, no scheduler dependency. Install NJobDesk.AspNetCore for the dashboard API and UI, plus a provider package (Quartz via uQuartz, Hangfire, Umbraco).",
